  "StockRole": "Industrial Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "Majesty Metals built this one for the Magistracy during the Succession Wars when good armor was hard to come by. Primary job is combat rescue, not fighting, though it can do both. That cargo bay is actually a full medical transport for six or seven people with a medic onboard. Star Corporal Sara Evans made a name for herself in a C22 charging into hot zones to pull soldiers out before a pirate Stalker finally got her in 3026.",
